{"parse": {"title": "PD-00", "pageid": 144769, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><span style=\"display: inline-block; width: 28px;\"></span><span class=\"nav-page-name\">PD-00</span><a href=\"/wiki/PD-01\" title=\"PD-01\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">PD</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">00</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E6.95.9E.E5.BC.80\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"敞开\">敞开</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 敞开</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">A New Gate Opened</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span class=\"color-value\"></span>观<span class=\"color-value\"></span>测<span class=\"color-value\"></span>，<span class=\"color-value\"></span>记<span class=\"color-value\"></span>录<span class=\"color-value\"></span>，<span class=\"color-value\"></span>保<span class=\"color-value\"></span>持<span class=\"color-value\"></span>好<span class=\"color-value\"></span>奇<span class=\"color-value\"></span>，<span class=\"color-value\"></span>抵<span class=\"color-value\"></span>达<span class=\"color-value\"></span>异<span class=\"color-value\"></span>乡<span class=\"color-value\"></span>。<span class=\"color-value\"></span></div><div class=\"grey-small hide-m\" style=\"float:right;\">ID: 38510101</div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-jijinhuizoulang2.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"jijinhuizoulang2\"><img alt=\"jijinhuizoulang2\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b1/Cg-jijinhuizoulang2.png/600px-Cg-jijinhuizoulang2.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b1/Cg-jijinhuizoulang2.png/900px-Cg-jijinhuizoulang2.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b1/Cg-jijinhuizoulang2.png/1200px-Cg-jijinhuizoulang2.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>银白色的建筑中，一位研究者步履轻捷，引领着身后跟随的人径直走向回廊深处。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小梅斯梅尔：</div><div>“雨幕舞台”？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>没错，在这个舞台上每一次观测都可实现其独一无二的价值。维尔汀，你上次的感受如何？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>一次令人印象深刻的旅行，我们以另一种方式回到了更早的时代。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>像“暴雨”一样，不是吗？只不过，这是足够安全的另一场雨，并不会威胁实验者的生命。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小梅斯梅尔：</div><div>……我想我该拒绝你。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>别急着下判断，来看看吧，也许你会感兴趣的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"650815.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0f/HeadIconSmall-650815.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-650815.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"650815.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0f/HeadIconSmall-650815.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-650815.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0f/HeadIconSmall-650815.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-650815.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>我们到了。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-s02_bg_18.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"s02_bg_18\"><img alt=\"s02_bg_18\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0a/Cg-s02_bg_18.png/600px-Cg-s02_bg_18.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0a/Cg-s02_bg_18.png/900px-Cg-s02_bg_18.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0a/Cg-s02_bg_18.png/1200px-Cg-s02_bg_18.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>另一个全新陌生的世界，一份纯净、尚未被干涉的原始记录。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>这次，世界又会因为哪一处的涟漪产生变化？找到这个问题的答案，就需要二位的协助了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小梅斯梅尔：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>小梅斯梅尔仔细审视着少年面上的愉悦。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>周遭光线昏暗，唯有几束白色的灯光将视线引向置于房间中央的环形机器之上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"305701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cd/HeadIconSmall-305701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-305701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"305701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cd/HeadIconSmall-305701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-305701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cd/HeadIconSmall-305701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-305701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小梅斯梅尔：</div><div>这就是“惠更斯-菲涅尔干涉仪”？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"650815.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0f/HeadIconSmall-650815.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-650815.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"650815.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0f/HeadIconSmall-650815.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-650815.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0f/HeadIconSmall-650815.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-650815.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>是的，通过它，我们能体验到全然不同的全景观测空间——也就是雨幕舞台。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>小梅斯梅尔向前走去，近距离地观察面前的庞然大物。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>这里有一本《观测指南》，上面有更详尽的关于这台仪器的介绍。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>尽管吸收知识最好的手段是体验，但小梅斯梅尔，你是第一次参与，这份册子说不定能帮上你。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小梅斯梅尔：</div><div>别急着下判断，X。我依旧有拒绝的权利。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一句耳熟的话，X莞尔一笑。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小梅斯梅尔：</div><div>这是属于拉普拉斯的资产吗？这间实验室、这台仪器，此前我从未接触，甚至从未听闻过。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小梅斯梅尔：</div><div>我不会断言我熟知拉普拉斯这所机构里所有设备，只是这种分量的仪器，它的研发过程不会悄无声息。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小梅斯梅尔：</div><div>但我知道的是，在这里，也正栖息着一只“蝴蝶”。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"650815.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0f/HeadIconSmall-650815.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-650815.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"650815.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0f/HeadIconSmall-650815.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-650815.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0f/HeadIconSmall-650815.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-650815.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小梅斯梅尔：</div><div>X，你邀请我前来实验的原因，是想让我协助你在舞台上收集交互过程中影响大脑的参数。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小梅斯梅尔：</div><div>毕竟我常年研究人工梦游，与人们的大脑打交道。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小梅斯梅尔：</div><div>但这个课题，是“你”的课题，还是……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fa/HeadIconSmall-308601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fa/HeadIconSmall-308601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fa/HeadIconSmall-308601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>抱歉，我来晚了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>高密度的金属与地面碰撞，意识唤醒者的脚步激起一阵响亮的回声。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小梅斯梅尔：</div><div>露西女士，您来了？！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>噢——看来这会是第一个变量。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>意料之外的来访者，让众人暂时无暇顾及先前的疑问。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>抱歉，X，是我邀请露西女士前来的。上一次实验过后，我和露西女士交流了一些内容。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>嗯，一个完全关于“观测”的实验，意识与混沌粒子的交互将产生一个足够逼真的现实空间。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>一个意识唤醒者无法拒绝这样的邀请，这是一场极具价值的实验——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>它的价值并不局限于某一个体、某间实验室，而是属于拉普拉斯众人，以及所有带有探索渴望的人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>钢铁拼接的“脸”微微扬起，面对这台仪器，条屏闪着光，这可被理解为思索的状态。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>嗯——我赞同露西女士～</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>我想这也是对小梅斯梅尔的疑问，一个最好的回答。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>X向一旁的小梅斯梅尔眨了眨眼。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>那么接着来谈谈这次的实验吧。结合上一次的实验数据，干涉仪进行了相应的改进。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>现在，我们可以通过混沌粒子的投影对舞台内的情况做一些模糊的预测。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-s02_bg_19.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"s02_bg_19\"><img alt=\"s02_bg_19\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/92/Cg-s02_bg_19.png/600px-Cg-s02_bg_19.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/92/Cg-s02_bg_19.png/900px-Cg-s02_bg_19.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/92/Cg-s02_bg_19.png/1200px-Cg-s02_bg_19.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>X走上干涉仪的操作台，按下几个按键。广场、实验室、卧室……不同场景轮番出现在屏幕上。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-s02_bg_08.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"s02_bg_08\"><img alt=\"s02_bg_08\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3d/Cg-s02_bg_08.png/600px-Cg-s02_bg_08.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3d/Cg-s02_bg_08.png/900px-Cg-s02_bg_08.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3d/Cg-s02_bg_08.png/1200px-Cg-s02_bg_08.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"305712.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-305712.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-305712.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"305712.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-305712.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-305712.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-305712.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-305712.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小梅斯梅尔：</div><div>这是苏联……？但看上去与资料记载的并不一致。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-s02_bg_19.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"s02_bg_19\"><img alt=\"s02_bg_19\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/92/Cg-s02_bg_19.png/600px-Cg-s02_bg_19.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/92/Cg-s02_bg_19.png/900px-Cg-s02_bg_19.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/92/Cg-s02_bg_19.png/1200px-Cg-s02_bg_19.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"650815.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0f/HeadIconSmall-650815.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-650815.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"650815.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0f/HeadIconSmall-650815.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-650815.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0f/HeadIconSmall-650815.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-650815.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>我认为，将它称呼为“苏联的某种可能性”会更为准确些。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-s02_bg_18.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"s02_bg_18\"><img alt=\"s02_bg_18\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0a/Cg-s02_bg_18.png/600px-Cg-s02_bg_18.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0a/Cg-s02_bg_18.png/900px-Cg-s02_bg_18.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0a/Cg-s02_bg_18.png/1200px-Cg-s02_bg_18.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>这就是我们这次要探索的雨幕舞台，从目前收集到的信息来看，它向我们展现了一个科技急速发展的苏联。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>一个崇尚理性与秩序，没有神秘学家的地方。小梅斯梅尔，这是否能进一步减轻你的担忧呢？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>以及，你的身边还有维尔汀与露西女士的陪同。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小梅斯梅尔：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小梅斯梅尔：</div><div>我的确产生了好奇心。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>呼——很好。我会在这儿尽力支援你们，这台仪器的确有尚待挖掘的部分，但大部分问题我都能解决。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>X研究员，我可以代替你操作干涉仪。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>嗯？但……我想您并不清楚具体的操作步骤。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>我可以通过你的演示学习基本的使用方法，剩下的，我相信你作为研究员一定也保存了操作记录。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>这台仪器本身具有独特的探索价值，上手操作能够让我迅速理解其原理，这会对拉普拉斯的其他研究起到帮助。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>下次再见到阿德勒研究员时，就可以向他传达了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>以露西女士的算力能更快解决干涉仪出现的问题。小梅斯梅尔也会更加放心一些。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>……看来我并没有太多拒绝空间。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>X沉吟片刻。在当下的处境里试图保守洛伦兹的秘密已极难做到。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他转头看向干涉仪。他熟知这台仪器的操作，却从未成为实验对象。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>一份纯净的、未被干涉的原始记录……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>存在即影响，他可以亲身验证。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>X笑了起来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>露西女士，这的确是一个很好的提议。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>随着意识唤醒者的操作，干涉仪内缓缓落下细雨。随后，雨滴如泪珠般悬浮在半空，微微地颤抖。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fa/HeadIconSmall-308601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fa/HeadIconSmall-308601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fa/HeadIconSmall-308601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>干涉仪启动成功。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>您的上手速度的确很快。噢，还有一件事——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>X拿出一个近似于BB机的通讯设备。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"650815.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0f/HeadIconSmall-650815.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-650815.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"650815.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0f/HeadIconSmall-650815.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-650815.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0f/HeadIconSmall-650815.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-650815.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>这个通讯仪可供雨幕舞台内的成员跟外界沟通。这也是基于上次实验的改进成果。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"650815.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0f/HeadIconSmall-650815.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-650815.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"650815.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0f/HeadIconSmall-650815.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-650815.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0f/HeadIconSmall-650815.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-650815.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>实验过程中遇上任何问题，我们都会用这个通讯仪与您联系。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她接过X递来的通讯仪。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fa/HeadIconSmall-308601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fa/HeadIconSmall-308601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fa/HeadIconSmall-308601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>好。请各位做好准备，舞台即将拉开帷幕。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"650815.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0f/HeadIconSmall-650815.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-650815.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"650815.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0f/HeadIconSmall-650815.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-650815.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0f/HeadIconSmall-650815.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-650815.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>辛苦了，露西女士。我会给您带点小礼物回来的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fa/HeadIconSmall-308601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fa/HeadIconSmall-308601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fa/HeadIconSmall-308601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>谢谢。预祝各位一切顺利。</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "PD-00"}}